#: advanceddialog.cpp:126
msgid ""
"Specify the priority that the screensaver will run at. A higher priority may "
"mean that the screensaver runs faster, though may reduce the speed that other "
"programs run at while the screensaver is active."
msgstr ""
"Küräk-saqçı nindi östenlek belän eşlärgä tieşlegen bilgeli. Yuğarıraq östenlek "
"belän cibärelgändä, küräk-saqçınıñ eşläwe tizräk buluı bar, dimäk saqçı eşlägän "
"çaqta başqa yazılımnarnıñ eşe äkrenäyer."

#: advanceddialog.cpp:127
msgid ""
"The action to take when the mouse cursor is located in the top left corner of "
"the screen for 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Küse uğı küräkneñ öske sul poçmağında 15 sekund buyı torsa, bu eş eşläner."

#: advanceddialog.cpp:128
msgid ""
"The action to take when the mouse cursor is located in the top right corner of "
"the screen for 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Küse uğı küräkneñ öske uñ poçmağında 15 sekund buyı torsa, bu eş eşläner."

#: advanceddialog.cpp:129
msgid ""
"The action to take when the mouse cursor is located in the bottom left corner "
"of the screen for 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Küse uğı küräkneñ asqı sul poçmağında 15 sekund buyı torsa, bu eş eşläner."

#: advanceddialog.cpp:130
msgid ""
"The action to take when the mouse cursor is located in the bottom right corner "
"of the screen for 15 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Küse uğı küräkneñ asqı uñ poçmağında 15 sekund buyı torsa, bu eş eşläner."

