#: scrnsave.cpp:89
msgid ""
"<h1>Screen Saver</h1> This module allows you to enable and configure a screen "
"saver. Note that you can enable a screen saver even if you have power saving "
"features enabled for your display."
"<p> Besides providing an endless variety of entertainment and preventing "
"monitor burn-in, a screen saver also gives you a simple way to lock your "
"display if you are going to leave it unattended for a while. If you want the "
"screen saver to lock the session, make sure you enable the \"Require password\" "
"feature of the screen saver; if you do not, you can still explicitly lock the "
"session using the desktop's \"Lock Session\" action."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Küräk Saqçısı</h1> Bu mudul aşa küräk saqçısın caylap bula. Belep torası: "
"küräk öçen qüät saqlaw çarası açılğan bulsa ğına küräk-saqçını cibärep bula."
"<p> Monnan tış, ozaqqa kitep barğanda küräk üz eşläw waqıtın buşqa tuzdırmasın "
"öçen dä küräk-saqçıdan uñaylıq kürep bula. Küräk-saqçı sessine bikli dä ala, "
"bonı öçen ul saqçınıñ caylawında \"Sersüz kiräk\" digän çaranı açası, yä isä "
"sessine quldan da bikläp bula."

#: scrnsave.cpp:132
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "Küräk Saqlağıç"

#: scrnsave.cpp:147
msgid "Select the screen saver to use."
msgstr "Qullanası küräksaqçın saylaw."

#: scrnsave.cpp:150
msgid "&Setup..."
msgstr "&Caylaw..."

#: scrnsave.cpp:154
msgid "Configure the screen saver's options, if any."
msgstr "Alay bulsa, küräk-saqçınıñ köylämälären cayla."

#: scrnsave.cpp:156
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Sınaw"

#: scrnsave.cpp:160
msgid "Show a full screen preview of the screen saver."
msgstr "Küräk-saqçını böten küräkkä kürsätep birü."

#: scrnsave.cpp:162
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Köyläw"

#: scrnsave.cpp:169
msgid "Start a&utomatically"
msgstr "Üzennän &cibäräse"

#: scrnsave.cpp:172
msgid "Automatically start the screen saver after a period of inactivity."
msgstr "Eşsez toru arası ütkännän soñ, küräksaqçı üzennän üze cibäreler."

#: scrnsave.cpp:180 scrnsave.cpp:213
msgid "After:"
msgstr "Monnan soñ:"

#: scrnsave.cpp:186
#, fuzzy
msgid " min"
msgstr "1 minut"

#: scrnsave.cpp:195
msgid "The period of inactivity after which the screen saver should start."
msgstr "Eşsez toru arası bu, ul ütkäç küräksaqçı cibäräläçäk."

#: scrnsave.cpp:201
msgid "&Require password to stop"
msgstr "&Tuqtatırğa sersüz kiräk"

#: scrnsave.cpp:208
msgid ""
"Prevent potential unauthorized use by requiring a password to stop the screen "
"saver."
msgstr ""
"Küräk-saqçı eşen tuqtatuın sersüz belän bikläp, tanılmağan qullanudan saqlanıp "
"bula."

#: scrnsave.cpp:216
msgid ""
"The amount of time, after the screen saver has started, to ask for the unlock "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Küräk-saqçı eşli başlawdan soñ, monda kertelgän ara uzğaç, bik töşerü öçen "
"sersüz soralaçaq."

#: scrnsave.cpp:221
#, fuzzy
msgid " sec"
msgstr "1 sekund"

#: scrnsave.cpp:239
msgid "Choose the period after which the display will be locked. "
msgstr "Bu ara uzğaç uzudan soñ küräk biklängän bulaçaq. "

#: scrnsave.cpp:253
msgid "A preview of the selected screen saver."
msgstr "Saylanğan küräksaqçın qarap alu."

